 Left Join GenDTab G11 on (H11.FLDTAB=1 and G11.FLDID=AInfo.FLDID11 and G11.ValueID=AInfo.ValueID11)
 Left Join GenDTab G12 on (H12.FLDTAB=1 and G12.FLDID=AInfo.FLDID12 and G12.ValueID=AInfo.ValueID12)
